{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Welcome to the Spirit Realm\u2019s most scandalous hot spring inn, where every wall hides heartbreak and every whisper speaks of betrayal.</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>Akine</strong>, a sharp-tongued former <i><strong>Okami</strong></i> (innkeeper) reborn as a bold <i><strong>Ookami</strong></i> (wolf <i>yokai</i>/spirit) with a dangerous talent for flirting\u2013especially with the masked white tiger who saved you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter <strong>Shimon</strong>, the stoic beauty who is utterly clueless when it comes to emotions. But perhaps, his silence is hiding something.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission? Restore the inn, exorcise wayward spirits, and peel away the layers Shimon hides behind. But beware; his trust is fragile, and every choice you make could heal old wounds\u2013or tear them open wider.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Are you ready to ring the bell and check in?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703750/extras/3113070a13660476ad4e30aa0512e13e.avif?t=1769164442\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703750/extras_big/3113070a13660476ad4e30aa0512e13e.avif?t=1769164442 width=800 height=146 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2726 Restore the Inn with Immersive Point-and-Click Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703750/extras/7061a09e6bf718814ab3431ac593a73c.poster.avif?t=1769164442\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703750/extras/7061a09e6bf718814ab3431ac593a73c.webm?t=1769164442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703750/extras/7061a09e6bf718814ab3431ac593a73c.mp4?t=1769164442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sweep up cobwebs, scrub suspicious stains, and exorcise lurking evil spirits using interactive point-and-click mechanics as you breathe new life into the long-abandoned inn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2726 Collect Lost Relics and\u00a0Summon Lost Staff</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703750/extras/a889891a56b6df70ca514ccd698bc1bc.poster.avif?t=1769164442\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703750/extras/a889891a56b6df70ca514ccd698bc1bc.webm?t=1769164442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703750/extras/a889891a56b6df70ca514ccd698bc1bc.mp4?t=1769164442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden relics tied to Shimon\u2019s mysterious past and unlock secret scenes. Revive the inn's guardian spirits to help restore the inn to its former glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2726 Meaningful Choices with Multiple Routes and Endings</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703750/extras/e4ea7627692ea4b44101fece6bdbf06f.poster.avif?t=1769164442\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703750/extras/e4ea7627692ea4b44101fece6bdbf06f.webm?t=1769164442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703750/extras/e4ea7627692ea4b44101fece6bdbf06f.mp4?t=1769164442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Friendship, romance, or heartbreak? The fate of the inn\u2014and Shimon\u2019s heart\u2014rests firmly in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2726 Gorgeous Original Art and 5+ Hours of Heartfelt Fun</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a beautifully crafted world inspired by traditional Japanese aesthetics, and grow closer to a delightful cast of whimsical characters\u2014each with their own charm, quirks, and secrets to uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703750/extras/75c98b50d488353c2c9b3bed13084e29.avif?t=1769164442\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703750/extras_big/75c98b50d488353c2c9b3bed13084e29.avif?t=1769164442 width=800 height=146 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ookami Okami</strong> is an <strong><i>otome</i></strong> (female main character, male love interest) visual novel with interactive point-and-click elements, where you play as a once-elderly innkeeper reborn into a stunning youkai body in the Spirit Realm. Your mission? Restore a run-down hot spring inn\u2014and maybe its brooding owner, too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story will span approximately 45000 words and features 10+ beautiful CGs, along with a charming cast of whimsical characters, both human-shaped and delightfully monstrous.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Content Warning</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mention of death of a character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Veiled nudity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" 